                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "After YEARS of searching both on Steam and the Google Play store, I finally found a Super Puzzle Fighter clone that lives up to the original! Music is great, animation is great, gameplay is fast, and specials gives game a jolt of fun. \n\nWhile the game is in Early Access --> the devs consider this their passion project and are still working towards a final build. As it is now, it is a stable/ great game!\n\ntl;dr: BUY NOW, THANK ME LATER\n\n- Strafe",
